# Future Immich originals job (AWS Glacier / S3).
#
# Not active yet. To enable, create an S3-compatible remote named aws-glacier
# and add this job to jobs.conf:
#
#   "immich-photos|/mnt/immich/data/upload|aws-glacier:hearthdeck-backups/photos|copy|photos.rclone|--s3-storage-class=DEEP_ARCHIVE"
#
# Photos are append-only: rclone copy never deletes from the remote. Immich's
# own upload tree has no cache or generated files in it, so everything is data.
# Uncomment the rules below if that ever changes.

# - /thumbs/**
# - /encoded-video/**
